WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.220
Before uploading, check the bundle:

2
00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:08.543
run the upload command on .scry/capture with the dry-run flag.

3
00:00:08.593 --> 00:00:12.497
It validates the bundle and zips it locally.

4
00:00:12.547 --> 00:00:16.299
Nothing is sent, and no API key is needed.

5
00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:21.672
A good bundle prints Bundle valid with the number of captures.

